  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Device protocol",
      "items": [
        "One /mdm URL serves check-in and connect, forked on Content-Type",
        "DDM has no device URL of its own: it arrives as a check-in message",
        "Identity comes from SCEP or ACME with Managed Device Attestation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Server",
      "items": [
        "Roles mdm, ddm, or all from one binary",
        "service.Core never imports ddm; the engine plugs in as a DMHandler",
        "ddm.Notifier enqueues the command and calls push; the Engine only writes change rows in its transaction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Admin plane",
      "items": [
        "Bearer token, then Cedar authorizes every admin action",
        "/admin/v1/dep and /admin/v1/axm drive the service clients",
        "dep authenticates with OAuth 1.0a, axm with an ES256 client assertion, gdmf is unauthenticated"
      ]
    }
  ]
